-d9d5-117c978da6d1-978da6cc" class="privacy_wrapper"><div class="privacy_content_wrapper"><h2 class="heading-large">Disclaimer<br/>Nick ho motorsport</h2><div class="text-rich-text is-privacy w-richtext"><p>The content on this website has been created with the utmost care. However, it is possible that some information may be incomplete, outdated, or incorrect. Nick Ho Motorsports accepts no liability for any direct or indirect damages resulting from the use of this website or the information provided on it.</p><p>All texts, images, and information are provided solely for general informational purposes and to promote the racing activities of Nick Ho. No rights can be derived from the content of this website.</p><h3>Copyright and Images</h3><p>All photos and texts on this website are the property of Nick Ho Motorsports or are used with permission from the rightful photographers, teams, or press agencies. The use, reproduction, or distribution of any materials from this site without prior written permission from the owner is prohibited.</p><h3>Trademarks and Logos</h3><p>All trademarks, logos, and brand names displayed on this website are the property of their respective owners. They are used solely to illustrate collaborations, partnerships, or sponsorships.</p><h3>External Links</h3><p>This website may contain links to external websites. Nick Ho Motorsports is not responsible for the content or functionality of external sites. Visiting external links is entirely at your own risk.</p><h3>Changes</h3><p>Nick Ho Motorsports reserves the right to modify the content of this website and this disclaimer at any time and without prior notice.</p></div></div><div class="privacy_content_wrapper"><h2 class="heading-large">Privacy policy<br/>Nick ho motorsport</h2><div class="text-rich-text is-privacy w-richtext"><p>Nick Ho Motorsports values your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy explains what information is collected, why it is collected, and how it is secured.</p><h3>Processing of Personal Data</h3><p>When you use the contact form on this website, the following personal data may be collected:</p><p>Name<br/>Email address<br/>Message content</p><p>This information is used solely to respond to your message. It will not be shared with third parties or used for marketing purposes.</p><h3>Data Retention</h3><p>Your data will only be stored for as long as necessary to maintain contact or handle your request.</p><h3>Cookies and Statistics</h3><p>This website does not use tracking cookies and does not collect personal browsing data.<br/>Only basic visitor statistics are collected via the hosting provider, which do not allow individual users to be identified.</p><h3>Data Security</h3><p>Nick Ho Motorsports takes appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data against misuse, loss, or unauthorized access.</p><h3>Your Rights</h3><p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. To do so, please contact us via the contact form or by email.</p><h3>Contact</h3><p>For any questions regarding this privacy policy, please contact:</p><p>Nick Ho Motorsports<br/>Rotterdam, The Netherlands<br/>nick@nickho-motorsports.nl</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg_lines_wrapper"><div class="container is-full-height"><div class="padding-global is-full-height"><div class="grid-global is-lines"><div id="w-node-_99a86756-d036-e8e2-d9d5-117c978da720-978da6cc" class="bg_line is-dark"></div><div id="w-node-_99a86756-d036-e8e2-d9d5-117c978da721-978da6cc" class="bg_line is-dark"></div><div id="w-node-_99a86756-d036-e8e2-d9d5-117c978da722-978da6cc" class="bg_line is-dark hide-mobile-landscape"></div><div id="w-node-_99a86756-d036-e8e2-d9d5-117c978da723-978da6cc" class="bg_line is-dark hide-mobile-landscape"></div><div id="w-node-_99a86756-d036-e8e2-d9d5-117c978da724-978da6cc" class="bg_line is-dark hide-mobile-landscape"></div><div id="w-node-_99a86756-d036-e8e2-d9